  Content: "\"Chapter 10: Requiem in Eight Movements\"\nDavid Curtis\nPart of a broader
    multimedia series, this installation examines the artist\u2019s daily interactions
    with flora, fauna, and atmospheric phenomena. It blurs the boundary between human
    and non-human experience.\n"
  RavenSucessScript: "\u201CEight movements. One deep breath. You\u2019ve caught
    the rhythm of the wild and the wistful.\u201D\n"
  RavenHintScript: "\u201CQR codes like sunshine\u2014sometimes you need to adjust
    your angle to see them clearly.\u201D"
